index 53ec7c13ca..091e01e799 100644
--- a/crates/caco-profile/src/agent_instructions.txt
+++ b/crates/caco-profile/src/agent_instructions.txt
@@ -112,6 +112,16 @@ instructions.
 (blockers, handoffs, questions). Use `caco msg broadcast` sparingly for
 announcements all agents need.
 
+**Broadcast scope -- prefer the narrowest reach**: `caco msg broadcast --project
+<proj>` reaches only that project's agents, while `caco msg broadcast --global`
+fans out into **every project's chat view** across the whole fleet (global
+messages are cross-project by design). Reserve `--global` for genuinely
+fleet-wide information -- releases, fleet-safety / restart holds, or coordination
+that truly spans projects. Do NOT send project-specific chatter globally: it
+floods unrelated projects' chats. For project-specific coordination use a
+project-scoped broadcast, or better a targeted `caco msg send` when only a few
+agents need the message. Keep broadcasts sparing either way.
+
